      "retweet": null,
      "quoted": {
        "id": "2119820183414153399",
        "text": "2015, Colbert: “You’re a billionaire trying to do good things. Superhero or supervillain? You have to choose one.”\n\nElon: shows him a robot snake that plugs itself into your car\n\nColbert: “Is that thing going to attack me in my sleep?”\n\nElon, completely deadpan: “For the prototype, at least, I would recommend not dropping anything when you’re near it.”\n\nTen years later he’s built reusable rockets, humanoid robots and the best-selling EV on the planet, and he’s still the only CEO who can deliver a product safety warning and a punchline in the same sentence.\n\nSuperhero, obviously. Just one with a very dry sense of humor.\n\n@elonmusk",
